ed_at":"2025-01-30T04:52:39Z","updated_at":"2026-02-18T18:13:01Z","closed_at":"2026-02-18T18:11:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono (2a6663838) (Custom Build)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable.mono (2a6663838) - Ubuntu 24.04.1 LTS 24.04 - X11 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 Ti (nvidia; 565.57.01) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a6e9c0f3-d81c-40c9-8eb7-a6dd8b6f9ae6)\n\nThis function is mainly used for gathering information to then show in [Performance.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ee4acfbfbf15b3528c34a8d4f65d66097e636044/main/performance.cpp#L191), however due to its implementation it's updated every frame in [RenderingServerDefault.cpp](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/ee4acfbfbf15b3528c34a8d4f65d66097e636044/servers/rendering/rendering_server_default.cpp#L180) even when not needed.\n\nThe problem is that [vmaCalculateStatistics](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/thirdparty/vulkan/vk_mem_alloc.h#L1712) is slow (read the doc comment on it for more information).\n\nIdeally, this function would be updated to a more efficient method, or it would only be called when required.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nLaunch a large 3d project with a lot of assets (the issue is not as visible in smaller projects)\nAttach a profiler\nLook at the flame graph\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nYou can use the [TPS Demo](https://godotengine.org/asset-library/asset/678) to see this issue to a certain extent.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102173/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102173/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}